xGeometry x="20.0" y="546.0" width="1420.0" height="34.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v24" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13.5px;color:#1f1f1f;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;İstek yolu (numaralar)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;1  mobile-bff → (ztunnel → HBONE mTLS) → ödeme waypoint: iç JWT, scope, acr, kaynak SA kontrolü    2  waypoint → transfer :8080&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;3  transfer → hesap waypoint → account-api (sahiplik ve bakiye)    4  transfer → fraud-svc (risk; yüksek risk → step-up / insan onayı)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;5  transfer → PostgreSQL (int-egressgw üzerinden): transfer kaydı + outbox    6  debezium (olay ns) outbox'u Kafka'ya taşır → bildirim, raporlama&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fffdf3;strokeColor=#d8cfa3;strokeWidth=1.3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v3"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="594.0" width="1420.0" height="89.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v26" value='&lt;span style="font-size:14px;color:#1f1f1f;font-weight:bold;"&gt;İmaj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;"&gt;Harbor (iç registry) · cosign imzalı · SBOM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;"&gt;Kyverno: imzasız / latest reddedilir&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6d9fe4;strokeWidth=1.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v25"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="56.0" width="610.0" height="66.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v27" value='&lt;span style="font-size:14px;color:#1f1f1f;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Çalışma&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;"&gt;runAsNonRoot · readOnlyRootFilesystem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;"&gt;seccomp RuntimeDefault · yetenek: hiçbiri&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;"&gt;PSA restricted (namespace)&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6d9fe4;strokeWidth=1.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v25"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="132.0" width="610.0" height="84.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v28" value='&lt;span style="font-size:14px;color:#1f1f1f;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Kaynak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;"&gt;requests / limits · HPA (CPU, istek sayısı)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;"&gt;PDB: en az 2 çalışır · topologySpread (DC, node)&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6d9fe4;strokeWidth=1.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v25"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="226.0" width="610.0" height="66.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v29" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#1f1f1f;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Kimlik&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;servis hesabı → SPIFFE kimliği (mesh)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;Kubernetes API token'ı yok (automount: false)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6d9fe4;strokeWidth=1.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v25"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="302.0" width="610.0" height="66.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v30" value='&lt;span style="font-size:14px;color:#1f1f1f;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Secret&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;"&gt;Vault → 