t;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;Veri servislerine yalnızca internal'ın int-egressgw'si ve servis başına kimlikle erişilir; DMZ'nin yolu yok.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;Her StatefulSet'in replikası DC içinde farklı node'larda; DC2'ye replikasyon (Data Guard, MirrorMaker2, CNPG replika cluster).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;PCI ayrı cluster ve segment: internal'a yalnızca token PAN gider; PAN, HSM ve kart DB'si PCI içinde kalır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;Core'a tek yol core-adapter (integration ns); core'un çıkışı yalnızca Oracle ve CDC.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fffdf3;strokeColor=#d8cfa3;strokeWidth=1.3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1200.0" width="1120.0" height="108.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v97" value="Lejant" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#fafaf8;strokeColor=#c4c4bf;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180.0" y="1200.0" width="1000.0" height="240.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v133" value="06 · Veri, core banking ve PCI cluster'ları" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#1f1f1f;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="21.0" width="651.0" height="33.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v134" value="StatefulSet'ler (replika rolleri), giriş gateway'leri, VM / appliance'lar · yeşil = kim girebilir, turuncu = nereye çıkar" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#5f5f5a;fontStyle=0;