tyle=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;Mgmt'e giriş tek yönlü: cluster'lar log / metrik / iz yazar, okuyamaz. Arayüzlere yalnızca bastion / PAM'dan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;Mgmt'ten çıkış: Argo CD (cluster API), Vault PKI (sertifika), Harbor (image çekme).&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fffdf3;strokeColor=#d8cfa3;strokeWidth=1.3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="1080.0" width="1100.0" height="108.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v103" value="Lejant" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#fafaf8;strokeColor=#c4c4bf;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150.0" y="1080.0" width="1030.0" height="240.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v137" value="07 · Kimlik ve yönetim / gözlem cluster'ları" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#1f1f1f;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="21.0" width="666.0" height="33.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v138" value="Keycloak StatefulSet'i ve yardımcı servisler · gözlem hattı, Vault, registry, GitOps · giriş ve çıkış yönleri" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#5f5f5a;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="62.0" width="965.2" height="21.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="⇥ in ← dmz-egressgw (auth-proxy, token handler) :443 · F5 auth VIP (giriş sayfası)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d7a46;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1d7a46;