e;html=1;startSize=26;rounded=1;arcSize=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6abd6a;strokeWidth=1.8;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;swimlaneLine=0;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=13.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f1f1f;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v14"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="390.0" width="330.0" height="95.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v35" value="⬡ node-exporter" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=26;rounded=1;arcSize=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6abd6a;strokeWidth=1.8;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;swimlaneLine=0;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=13.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f1f1f;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v14"><mxGeometry x="370.0" y="390.0" width="330.0" height="95.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v38" value="⬡ edr / falco" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=26;rounded=1;arcSize=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6abd6a;strokeWidth=1.8;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;swimlaneLine=0;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=13.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f1f1f;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v14"><mxGeometry x="720.0" y="390.0" width="320.0" height="95.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v41" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#1f1f1f;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Node katmanları&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;RHCOS (değiştirilemez OS) · CRI-O (container çalışma zamanı) · kubelet (pod yaşam döngüsü, :10250)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;OVN-Kubernetes: pod ağı + NetworkPolicy (deny-default) · /var/log/pods: container stdout dosyaları&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;node SSH kapalı; erişim yalnızca oc debug (PAM üzerinden, audit'li)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c4c4bf;strokeWidth=1.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v14"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="520.0" width="1020.0" height="96.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v42" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13.5px;color:#1f1f1f;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Pod'dan pod'a istek (numaralar)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;1  transfer, account-api'yi düz HTTP ile çağırır (uygulamanın gözünden hiçbir şey değişmez)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;2  istio-cni'nin nftables kuralı bağlantıyı yerel ztunnel'e (:15001) yönlendirir&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;3  ztunnel: kaynak = transfer'in SPIFFE kimliği; hedefin waypoint'i var → HBONE mTLS :15008 → waypoint&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;4  waypoint (L7): iç JWT, scope, AuthZ, retry → HBONE → hedef node'un ztunnel'i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;5  hedef ztunnel L4 politikası (yalnızca waypoint) → account-api :8080 (pod içi düz)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fffdf3;strokeColor=#d8cfa3;strokeWidth=1.3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v14"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="636.0" width="1020.0" height="126.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v44" value="aynı DaemonSet'ler" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#e4e4de;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v43"><mxGeometry x="925.2" y="6.0" width="124.8" height="16.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v45" value="◼ account-api (ns hesap)" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=26;rounded=1;arcSize=6;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6d9fe4;stroke